21
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,830
Insolent brat,

22
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:12,510
you will regret your recklessness !

23
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,430
Arrogant Junior,

24
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,630
how dare you harm an Elder of the Sun Family

25
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,430
