26
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,600
Sun Leng
Sun Family Elder
Peak Late stage
Soul Transformation

27
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,600
Sun Huan
Sun Family Elder
Peak Late stage
Soul Transformation

28
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,600
Sun Xu
Sun Family Elder
Peak Late stage
Soul Transformation

29
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:23,350
If you break your own arms and kneel in apology,

30
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:25,390
I will spare your life for now !

31
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:31,470
I met this Elder Sun through a transaction.

32
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:34,590
He obtained a flying sword and a bronze mirror

33
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,270
through a trade with me.

34
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,590
If you open his bag of holding,

35
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,790
you can verify what I said.

36
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,190
He coveted one of my artifacts

37
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,230
and tried to kill me for it.

38
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,870
After I drove him back,

39
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,950
he fled all the way here.

40
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:51,950
He's likely telling the truth...

41
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:55,470
But the Sun Family cannot tolerate a Junior running rampant !

42
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,590
No matter which family he is from,

43
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,790
we will capture him with the Demon Sealing Formation

44
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,350
and wait for his Elders

45
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,750
to decide whether he lives or dies !

46
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,550
Since you're doing this,

47
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:33,230
it seems the entire Sun Family is an accomplice.

48
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:43,470
What cultivation level does this child have !?

49
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,790
This pressure far exceeds Soul Transformation !

50
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,030
Could he be...

51
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:47,790
Fellow cultivator,

52
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,510
please calm your anger.

53
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,920
Sun Qiming
Sun Family Grand Elder
Peak Late stage Soul Transformation

54
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,070
Grand Elder !

55
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,790
Ascendant Divine Sense ?

56
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:58,750
The Sun Family has offended you, fellow cultivator.

57
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,550
We are willing to compensate for it.

58
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:02,920
Please tell us what you want, fellow cultivator.

59
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,030
Don't trouble my Juniors.

60
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,150
200 000 celestial jades

61
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,750
and this matter is settled.

62
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,800
Agreed.

63
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,550
But the amount you requested is too much.

64
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,590
We are only a branch of the Sun Family.

65
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:20,590
Fellow cultivator, please wait 3 days

66
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:23,390
to allow us to gather the celestial jades.

67
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,390
He agreed rather quickly...

68
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:29,470
If the Sun Family Ancestor is not magnanimous,

69
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,790
then he must have ulterior motives.

70
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,270
Agreed.

71
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:36,790
Giving 200 000 celestial jades at once

72
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,950
is a terrible loss

73
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,590
even for the main family !

74
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:42,350
The Ancestor personally ordered

75
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,550
to grant all his requests.

76
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,040
This is an order,

77
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,630
don't allow what happened today to leak.

78
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,670
And never disturb this person.

79
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:52,990
Anyone who causes trouble

80
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,550
will be immediately banished

81
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,910
until a decision is made.

82
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:01,350
Now that I have tens of thousands of celestial jades on me,

83
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,470
I need to absorb them all as soon as possible

84
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:06,070
to reach Middle stage Ascendant.

85
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,150
You...

86
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,110
Stop here.

87
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:11,510
Junior of the Sun Family...

88
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,990
If you dare to stir up trouble,

89
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,030
I will be merciless.

90
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,430
Do you know

91
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:20,430
what is most important for cultivation ?

92
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:22,150
Please enlighten me.

93
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:23,950
Let me tell you.

94
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,470
The most important is diligence !

95
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,510
Although you lack talent,

96
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,310
if you are diligent in your cultivation

97
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:30,910
you may still make progress one day.

98
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,190
I guard this Spirit Vein

99
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:36,190
and have seen many Core Formation, Nascent Soul and even Soul Formation cultivators.

100
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,190
But I have never seen anyone like you

101
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:41,270
that stops meditating to wander around the city in the morning.

102
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,510
The fiend usually kills without blinking an eye

103
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,990
but he's letting a Junior lecture him ?

104
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,710
This scene is probably a once-in-a-millennium event !

105
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:51,590
I must make sure to remember it !

106
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,470
Senior is right.

107
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,320
It’s not that I look down on you

108
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,950
but in this cultivation world

109
00:05:57,280 --> 00:05:59,750
only the self-reliant can go far.

110
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:02,830
If you have any questions about cultivation in the future,

111
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,190
you may ask me about them.

112
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:06,360
Remember to be diligent in your cultivation.

113
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:08,240
Don't let you mind and body be lazy.

114
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:09,800
You may go in now.

115
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,350
Although this person’s cultivation is weak,

116
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,430
compared to the deceit and treachery of the Alliance Star System,

117
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,550
this isn't unpleasant.

118
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:36,320
3 days later

119
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,590
After reaching Ascendant,

120
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,070
cultivating with celestial jades

121
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:43,110
consumes too much...

122
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,550
Even with the Sun Family’s 200 000 celestial jades,

123
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:49,550
I won't reach Middle stage Ascendant.

124
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,790
To make a push for the second step,

125
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:56,030
the amount of celestial jades needed is unimaginable.

126
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:58,750
The Celestial Realm is no more.

127
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:02,390
Maybe what the second step requires is not celestial jades,

128
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,950
but something else.

129
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:05,950
Senior,

130
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,670
Sun Qiming of the Sun Family requests an audience.

131
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:13,790
The 200 000 celestial jades have been sent from the main family.

132
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,630
Please Senior, check them.

133
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,040
No need.

134
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,270
You may leave.

135
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,350
Our last meeting was too short.

136
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,470
Junior still does not know your honorable name.

137
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,110
Xu Mu

138
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,390
Senior,

139
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:29,590
In 7 days, an auction will be held

140
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,270
at the Whole Treasure Pavilion.

141
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,520
Among the items,

142
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:34,830
there will be a grade 8 pseudo-divine pill.

143
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:36,950
Senior,

144
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,630
this is the invitation to the auction.

145
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:51,950
Reveal the information about the grade 8 pill to this person

146
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,630
to test him.

147
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:56,790
This pill is extremely effective for Ascendant cultivators.

148
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,470
If he is interested,

149
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,630
then he is just Ascendant

150
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,950
and he will surely take it.

151
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,350
And if he is not interested ?

152
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,070
Then his cultivation is above Ascendant

153
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,270
and you

154
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,960
must withdraw the Sun Family’s forces from the city

155
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,950
to avoid any further involvement.

156
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:24,990
Give it to me.

157
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,750
This kind of test

158
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:32,070
will not happen a second time.

159
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,830
Understood.

160
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,670
You've come...

161
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,750
Sit down.

162
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:53,950
The Sun Family invited me to the auction.

163
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,750
This kind of test feels strange.

164
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,790
Is there something wrong ?

165
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,550
I can feel that

166
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,430
they are afraid of something.

167
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:04,310
Afraid ?

168
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:09,230
They are indeed living in fear and dread.

169
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:10,630
They

170
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:13,950
have brought a huge disaster upon themselves.

171
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:16,230
4 years ago,

172
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:19,270
in the space near Planet Ran Yun,

173
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:22,110
the Sun Family Ancestor, Sun Xi,

174
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:25,430
Carefree Xanren, Zhao Chuanwen,

175
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:28,630
and the Ran Family Ancestor, Ran Xuefeng,

176
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,470
joined forces

177
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:35,110
to ambush and kill a severely wounded cultivator who had fled here.

178
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,950
They obtained 5 pills.

179
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:45,150
5 grade 8 pseudo-divine pills.

180
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:47,870
But after the excitement,

181
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,630
inside that person's bag of holding

182
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,510
they found

183
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,710
a token from...

184
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,750
Planet Thousand Illusions.

185
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:59,030
A token of the Huan Family.

186
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,160
The Huan Family ?

187
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:00,790
Yes !

188
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:05,830
The very Huan Family of Planet Thousand Illusions, the leader of the Northern Domain.

189
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:07,950
Ceng Niu,

190
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,390
do you know how the Huan Family acts

191
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:12,350
and how overbearing they are ?

192
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:13,950
If a family member is killed,

193
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,710
all parties involved

194
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,230
no matter their identity,

195
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,600
will have their entire family exterminated.

196
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:22,990
Even if the items from the dead person’s bag end up in someone else’s hands,

197
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,230
merely possessing them

198
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:26,190
is likely to be seen as provocation

199
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:28,030
and trigger their wrath.

200
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,910
That token

201
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:32,070
and those pills

202
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,670
are all death sentences.

203
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:37,310
Once you’re stained by them, you can’t shake them off.

204
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:38,790
These past 4 years,

205
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:41,030
they have been walking on thin ice

206
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,390
and living in fear that one day

207
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:46,350
the Huan Family’s thunderous wrath

208
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,510
will come for them.

209
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,870
So this auction

210
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,310
is a bait

211
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:53,870
to hook me

212
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,790
in this karma with the Huan Family.

213
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:58,670
They're trying to put me in the same boat as them.

214
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:03,950
They want to atone for their crime

215
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,830
to avoid the extermination of their families

216
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,630
by framing you.

217
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,870
If the Huan Family investigates,

218
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:12,070
they will put all the blame on you.

219
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,440
Or at least,

220
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:15,270
they'll use you as an excuse.

221
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,550
What a clever scheme,

222
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,630
shifting the blame on others to have them do the dirty work.

223
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,670
Ran Xuefeng...

224
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,550
Sun Xi...

225
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:26,670
Zhao Chuanwen...

226
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:29,070
This matter will have too many consequences,

227
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,550
don't get involved.

228
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:31,950
Thank you.

229
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,590
A grade 8 pseudo-divine pill

230
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:37,750
would at least allow me to directly reach Middle stage Ascendant.

231
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:40,350
To reach Planet Dong Lin as soon as possible,

232
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,150
I must obtain this pill.

233
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:44,630
This trap might be sinister

234
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,590
but I must walk into it.

235
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:54,360
Huan Family Ancestral Home
Planet Thousand Illusions

236
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:56,560
That family member went missing 4 years ago.

237
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:59,680
Huan Wuqing
Huan Family Ancestor

238
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:59,870
Why are we only dealing with it now ?

239
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,350
Ancestor,

240
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:03,350
that person was merely a branch family member.

241
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,190
The Huan Family has many members

242
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,640
so they're hard to track.

243
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:08,400
Huan Fengshen
Huan Family Head

244
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,630
We have only learned of this matter recently.

245
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:10,150
Ancestor, how do you think

246
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:12,190
we should handle this matter ?

247
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:14,430
Now that we know,

248
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,830
we can't ignore it anymore.

249
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:18,950
All those involved

250
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,710
must be eradicated !

251
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:23,990
Leave this matter to Huan Mei.

252
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:26,350
Let her assign her own people to handle it.

253
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,280
It's a perfect opportunity

254
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:30,190
to have her establish authority.

255
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,910
As the Ancestor orders.

256
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,470
I shall take my leave.

257
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:40,150
Ever since the Ancestor went to the Alliance and brought back Huan Mei,

258
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:41,480
3 months ago

259
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:43,430
he stopped dealing with affairs of the family.

260
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:44,950
From now on,

261
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:48,550
Huan Mei will be this old man’s core disciple.

262
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:51,390
Now, the Ancestor went out of his way

263
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:54,990
to sacrifice his cultivation and use the blood exchange ritual on an outsider.

264
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:59,110
Now he's helping her establish her authority in the family...

265
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:02,510
Does he really intend to give the Huan Family

266
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:05,430
to this woman ?

267
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:09,960
Attic
Huan Family Ancestral Home

268
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,750
Planet Ran Yun ?

269
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:20,790
Huan Dong,

270
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:23,880
Huan Dong
Huan Family
Peak Middle stage Ascendant

271
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,070
I'm here.

272
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:26,270
Your cultivation has reached Peak Middle stage Ascendant.

273
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:28,830
This trip should be easy.

274
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,160
Although this is a minor matter,

275
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:33,430
